- Two initial test assertions encoded incorrect Java assumptions and were
  corrected: the direct RPC fixture had expected non-null wrapper values on
  direct decode, and the validation matrix treated nullable wrapper fields as
  required. Both corrected expectations now reflect the Java oracle.

